{
 "_meta_workflow": "Niko-character variant of the Krea2->LTX-2.3 lane: the trained niko.safetensors LoRA is applied to the Krea 2 model+clip so the robot bunny stays on-model in every styled frame. Include the token 'niko' in --style-prompt. Everything else matches krea2_ltx_pipeline.json (241f @ 24fps).",
